          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Youtubers Life is the ultimate vlogger tycoon/life-sim videogame. The main aim of this title is to become the world’s greatest youtuber in history. To achieve it, you will have to edit videos, get in touch with other video bloggers and try that fame doesn’t overload you. Create your own online video channel and upload videos to increase your fanbase, but keep an eye on your daily tasks while you don’t lose track of your social life! You'll have to deal with fans, friends, family and time management! Increase your popularity so you can move to a new place and manage your own video content creators network company.",
